OL,3,GNEWSA'Gargantuan' student housing tower
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-storey tower providing
OL,7,Faccommodation for students has been
OL,8,Fapproved despite concerns over its
OL,9,Fsize.
OL,11,FThe scheme, which narrowly passed
OL,12,FNewcastle City Council's planning
OL,13,Fcommittee on Friday, will stand on the
OL,14,Fsite of the soon to be demolished
OL,15,FHadrian House office complex.
OL,17,FResidents had raised a number of
OL,18,Fconcerns, including Suzanne Hydes who
OL,19,Fsaid the tower was "gargantuan", would
OL,20,F"irrevocably alter" the cityscape and
OL,21,Fnegatively impact surrounding listed
OL,22,Fbuildings like the Laing Gallery.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
